      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "When the construction of the firework factory came to the stage of painting, a pump was put in. Then, all the painters in the neighbourhood were defeated by a severe disease whose characteristic was similar to that of a bad burn. An expert physician was instructed to attend to the victims and handle this case.",
