      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Being much more strict with himself, he devoted himself to the case. Apart from making enquiries, he made detailed charts and analysed the data cautiously. Finally, he drew a scientific conclusion, linking the disease to the radium in the pump.",
        "zh": "于是他更加严格地要求自己，全身心地投入这一病例的调查。除了询问情况，他还绘制了详细图表，谨慎地分析数据。最后，他得出了一个科学结论，把这种疾病与水泵里的镭联系起来。",
        "start": 95.81333333333333,
        "voiceEnd": 116.81,
        "end": 137.80666666666667,
